      "text": "The period 1914-1945 destroyed the first globalization, produced the worst economic catastrophe in recorded history, and rebuilt the foundation for a new global economic order. The gold standard propagated the Depression internationally. Misguided fiscal and monetary policy deepened it. And WWII ironically demonstrated Keynesian economics in the most definitive possible experiment."
